; Fernside Instruments — the generic sample journal for Phase 0.
;
; This is the accounting truth the golden core-invariant tests in tests/test_golden_core.py are derived from.  It
; is deliberately small: one ordinary year of a made-up company, in three commodities, with one correction.  It is
; an hledger journal so it reads the same way the real corpus does, but it belongs to no checkout and no customer.
;
; It is the *human-readable* source of truth.  The test posts the same facts through the repository API and checks
; the store's balances and report totals against the numbers this file implies.  If someone changes what an entry
; means, both the journal and the pinned expectations move together, which is the point: the fixture survives the
; schema replacements in Phases 1-6.

; --- declarations: the sample entity's chart and commodities -------------------------------------------------
commodity USD 1,000.00
commodity EUR 1,000.00
commodity JPY 1,000.

account assets:cash
account assets:cash-eur
account assets:cash-jpy
account assets:receivables
account liabilities:payables
account expenses:office
account income:sales
account equity:retained-earnings

; --- 2025: one ordinary year ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2025-01-02 * Opening balances
    assets:cash                    2,500.00 USD
    equity:retained-earnings      -2,500.00 USD

2025-02-10 * Sale — invoice 1001
    assets:cash                    1,200.00 USD
    income:sales                  -1,200.00 USD

2025-03-05 * Office supplies
    expenses:office                  300.00 USD
    assets:cash                     -300.00 USD

2025-04-01 * Sale — invoice 1002, in euros
    assets:cash-eur                  500.00 EUR
    income:sales                    -500.00 EUR

2025-05-20 * Office supplies, in yen
    expenses:office               12,000 JPY
    assets:cash-jpy              -12,000 JPY

2025-06-15 * Sale — invoice 1003, on account
    assets:receivables               800.00 USD
    income:sales                    -800.00 USD

2025-07-01 * Accountant fees, unpaid
    expenses:office                  450.00 USD
    liabilities:payables            -450.00 USD

; The correction of the 2025-03-05 supplies: the original is left standing, and this is its mirror.  A reason is
; required by the product and is recorded on the audit trail.
2025-08-10 * Reversal of the 2025-03-05 office supplies
    expenses:office                 -300.00 USD
    assets:cash                      300.00 USD
